This task supersedes the original March framing of "wire kanban_summary to system prompt". The current architecture already uses per-turn board context injection in src/owlbear/core/agent.py via BoardContextProvider, and src/owlbear/bootstrap/hooks.py no longer registers ContextInjectionHook.

## Goal

Remove the dead ContextInjectionHook module and its obsolete test coverage without changing the current board-context flow.

## Scope

Core-layer dead-code cleanup plus direct test cleanup for ContextInjectionHook references only.

Out of scope:
- src/owlbear/core/agent.py runtime instructions wiring
- src/owlbear/core/board_context.py provider behavior
- bootstrap construction outside preserving the current no-registration behavior
- OwlBearSettings / config changes

## Pattern References

- src/owlbear/core/agent.py
- src/owlbear/bootstrap/hooks.py
- tests/test_bootstrap.py::TestFromAC_ContextInjectionHookRemoval
- tests/test_hook_payloads.py::TestBuilderDiscovered::test_session_start_data_has_workspace_root_and_context
- docs/research/context-injection-hook-dead-code.md

## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] Delete src/owlbear/core/context_hook.py.
- [ ] After the change, no file under src/ imports or references owlbear.core.context_hook or ContextInjectionHook.
- [ ] Preserve the current bootstrap behavior: src/owlbear/bootstrap/hooks.py continues to register zero ContextInjectionHook handlers on SESSION_START.
- [ ] Remove obsolete hook-specific tests by deleting tests/test_context_hook.py and removing the ContextInjectionHook-specific sections from tests/test_session_hooks.py and tests/test_hook_consumer_types.py.
- [ ] After the change, no test imports owlbear.core.context_hook or ContextInjectionHook.
- [ ] Update tests/test_run_elimination.py so IN_SCOPE_FILES no longer references the deleted tests/test_context_hook.py.
- [ ] Retain SessionStartData.context in src/owlbear/core/hooks.py; the generic SESSION_START payload contract remains intact.
- [ ] Do not modify src/owlbear/core/agent.py, src/owlbear/core/board_context.py, src/owlbear/bootstrap/__init__.py, or OwlBearSettings in this task.
- [ ] tests/test_bootstrap.py::TestFromAC_ContextInjectionHookRemoval remains green without weakening its assertions.
- [ ] Task-scoped pytest covering tests/test_bootstrap.py, tests/test_hook_payloads.py, tests/test_hook_consumer_types.py, tests/test_session_hooks.py, and tests/test_run_elimination.py passes.
- [ ] ruff check passes for every changed file.